  "prompt": "How many customers had placed their most recent order more than 180 days before Voltmarkt's as-of date, 5 January 2026? Take each customer's latest order day in UTC (order times are stored in UTC) and count the days between that day and the as-of date; a customer counts when that number is above 180. Guest orders have no customer_id and do not count. Return one column, lapsed_customers. Return one row. Any row order is fine.",
